error[E0445]: a constant can only use pure code
  --> tests/programs/m147/impure.la:7:24
  |
7 | const CONFIG: string = load();
  |                        ^^^^^^
  |
  = help: `load` calls `read_file`, which reads files; a constant is computed before `main` and may not print, read or write files, use the operating system, call C, or start tasks, channels or actors: compute the value in `main` instead

For more about E0445, run `lughac explain E0445`.
